        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Although we are not currently subject to the CTA’s BOI reporting requirements as a result of the Interim Final Rule, we will continue to monitor FinCEN’s guidance, and any final rules or other regulatory developments relating to the CTA and will assess the applicability of any resulting reporting obligations.",
